    "rationale": "D224 unconditional LF before FROM/JOIN changes the shared SQL writer (SqlBuilder/SqlMutationBuilder + SqlText), provider dialects (Postgres/ClickHouse WrapTableFunction, SqlServerDialect) and the platform-newline emitters, so every provider's SELECT SQL-generation exact-string assertion is affected. Selectors are the affected top-level SQL-generation test classes carrying [Fact]/[Theory] per provider (core/alias/clickhouse/ef-core/mariadb/mysql/postgres/sqlite/sqlserver) plus the clickhouse.extensions and publicextensibility shared-contract suites exercised at the boundary. Rebuild affected: product and tests are compiled inputs.",
